Name: sacremoses
Short Name: sacremoses
URL: https://github.com/hplt-project/sacremoses
Version: 0.2.0
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: no
Shipped: yes

Description:
A Python port of the Moses tokenizer and detokenizer. Tark uses its English
detokenizer's rules on IndicTrans2's English output, and its English
punctuation normalizer and tokenizer's rules on macOS's English captions
before translating them.

Local Modifications:
MosesDetokenizer(lang="en") ported to C++ in
components/tark_captions/indic_text.cc; MosesPunctNormalizer(lang="en") and
MosesTokenizer(lang="en") without XML escaping in
components/tark_captions/english_text.cc. No Python is shipped.
